    {
      "key": 5,
      "casaubonCall": 1,
      "dictated": "Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. Cracoviae\", p.118 n207); Keys 5-10 are the first to sixth Calls of that morning (p.129 \"This is the fifth of this day\", p.133 \"This is the sixth\")",
      "note": "\"That is one Call.\" (p.121); p.191 margin \"Δ 5 / 1\"; p.190 \"Sapah It is the fifth, for 4 being Englished\" English given: Thursday 5 July 1584, Cracow (\"Thursday, Cracoviae, Julii 5. Mane, hora 8. fere\", p.189 n278); the English of this Call is p.191 (Δ there: \"I understand this to be the English of the fifth Call; and that before of the sixth\").",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 191, "leaf": 280, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 119, "leaf": 208, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 120, "leaf": 209, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 121, "leaf": 210, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 111, "leaf": 141, "field": "gd"}],
