    {
      "key": 6,
      "casaubonCall": 2,
      "dictated": "Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. Cracoviae\", p.118 n207); Keys 5-10 are the first to sixth Calls of that morning (p.129 \"This is the fifth of this day\", p.133 \"This is the sixth\")",
      "note": "\"That is the second.\" (p.123); p.190 margin \"Δ 6 / 2\" English given: Thursday 5 July 1584, Cracow (\"Thursday, Cracoviae, Julii 5. Mane, hora 8. fere\", p.189 n278); this Call's English (p.190) was given first, asked for as \"the first word of the Call ... Sapah\"; then \"You have OD the fourth word of that Call ... the whole Call is placed there\" and Dee's count \"the English parcels are 41, and the Call hath above 50\" (p.190); p.191 Δ settles it as \"the sixth\".",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 190, "leaf": 279, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 121, "leaf": 210, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 122, "leaf": 211, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 123, "leaf": 212, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 113, "leaf": 143, "field": "gd"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659", "equinox1912no8"], "covered": ["enochian", "english", "gd"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)"]},
      "rows": [
        {"english": "The Spirits", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "GAH", "pronunciation": "Gah."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Gahe"}}, "note": "the first words of the English, \"The Spirits of the fourth Angle are\", are printed beside E.K.'s report that they were written on his thumb (p.190); the rows split that line", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 190, "leaf": 279, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 121, "leaf": 210, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 113, "leaf": 143, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "of the fourth Angle", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "SDIU", "pronunciation": "es di u / S di u."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "sa-div"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 190, "leaf": 279, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 121, "leaf": 210, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 113, "leaf": 143, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "are", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CHIS", "pronunciation": "Chis,", "printed": "--HIS"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "cahisa"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals lose the first letter (\"--HIS\"); C from the pronunciation \"Chis,\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 190, "leaf": 279, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 121, "leaf": 210, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 113, "leaf": 143, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "Nine", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "EM", "pronunciation": "Em."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "em"}}, "note": "p.190: \"There was no word there that signified Nine, the third word should be E M.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 190, "leaf": 279, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 121, "leaf": 210, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 113, "leaf": 143, "field": "gd"}]},
