        {"english": "in our comforter.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "BIGLIAD", "pronunciation": "Bigli ad.", "printed": "BIGLIA.."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Bijil—IAD", "marker": "split"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals \"BIGLIA..\" (first letter also worn); D from the pronunciation \"Bigli ad.\"; then \"Nal. This is at an end.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 199, "leaf": 288, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 125, "leaf": 214, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 114, "leaf": 144, "field": "gd"}]}
