    {
      "key": 10,
      "casaubonCall": 6,
      "dictated": "Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. Cracoviae\", p.118 n207); Keys 5-10 are the first to sixth Calls of that morning (p.129 \"This is the fifth of this day\", p.133 \"This is the sixth\")",
      "note": "p.133 \"The end of that Call. Δ. This is the sixth.\"; p.192 margin \"Δ 6 / 10\" English given: Thursday 5 July 1584, Cracow (\"Thursday, Cracoviae, Julii 5. Mane, hora 8. fere\", p.189 n278) (p.192, given in two showings with a cloud between). Casaubon prints the English in the order received, in two showings: (1) \"The Thunders of Judgement and wrath ... laid up for the earth, that times 5678. in the 24th. parte of a moment roar with an hundred mighty Earth-quakes. And a Thousand surges which rest not [or] labour still, neither know.\" (2) \"Which burn night and day. And vomit out ... with poyson. These be the Thunders any time here. One rock bringeth out a thousand ... your noyses.\" Rows follow the Enochian, so rows 20-34 (\"Which\" .. \"the Thunders\") take parcels from the second showing and rows 35-50 from the first, and \"any time here\" (second showing) follows \"know.\" (first). Within the first showing \"Neasts / 22.\" and \"times / 5678.\" are in the English order, not the Enochian (OP VIRQ, DAOX COCASG). Three Dee words have no English parcel in Casaubon (the second COCASG, PLOSI, MATORB: english null); one English parcel, \"a thousand\" after \"bringeth out\", has no capitals entry and takes MATB from Nalvage's note",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 132, "leaf": 221, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 133, "leaf": 222, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 118, "leaf": 148, "field": "gd"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659", "equinox1912no8"], "covered": ["enochian", "english", "gd"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)", "the words Casaubon's print has damaged"]},
      "rows": [
        {"english": "The Thunders of Judgement and wrath.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CORAXO", "pronunciation": "Co rax o."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Coraxo"}}, "note": "Casaubon prints this English line as a heading over the three columns", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "are", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CHIS", "pronunciation": "Chis."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "cahisa"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "numbred", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CORMP", "pronunciation": "Cormp.", "printed": "CORM."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "coremepe"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals \"CORM.\"; P from the pronunciation \"Cormp.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "and", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "OD", "pronunciation": "Od."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "od"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "are harboured", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "BLANS", "pronunciation": "Blans."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "belanusa"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}]},
