        {"english": "are", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CHIS", "pronunciation": "Chis."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "cahisa"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "22.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "OP"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "ope"}}, "note": "not in the capitals column; placed by the instruction. English: Casaubon prints \"Neasts / 22.\" (word order of the English, not the Enochian); margin p.192 \"Op.... That you have not.\" Crowley prints uirequo before ope", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 117, "leaf": 147, "field": "gd"}]},
