        {"english": "I prepare", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "ABRAMG", "pronunciation": "Ab ramg. g, not as dg."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "aberameji"}}, "gdEnglish": "I have prepared (a place)", "note": "Pronunciation note \"g, not as dg.\" English \"I prepare\" with the gloss \"{ or, have prepared\" and margin \"Gabr.\".", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "for you.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "NONCP", "pronunciation": "Noncp.", "printed": "N · NCP (damaged)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "nonuçape"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. Second letter of the capitals lost; pronunciation \"Noncp.\" with \"Nonsp.\" printed above it. Crowley nonuçape (with cedilla). Followed by \"... Curtain is drawn. .. The end of this. ...... This is the seventh.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "Move", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "ZACAR"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Zodacare"}}, "note": "Printed once, with Key 1 (pp. 79-80, English p. 88); repeated here.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "therefore", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CA"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "eca"}}, "note": "Printed once, with Key 1 (pp. 79-80, English p. 88); repeated here. CA ('therefore') is in Key 1's ending and in Dee's note p.193 n282 that the closing words are '14 last words ... Zacar e ca, od zamran ...'; Crowley prints no word here for this Key and his English has no 'therefore'. Here Crowley does print it: 'Zodacare eca' (cf. Key 1's dictation p.80: 'E must come after R ... it is Zacare' then 'C A'), English 'Move therefore'.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "and", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "OD"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "od"}}, "note": "Printed once, with Key 1 (pp. 79-80, English p. 88); repeated here.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "shew your selves,", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "ZAMRAN"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Zodameranu"}}, "note": "Printed once, with Key 1 (pp. 79-80, English p. 88); repeated here.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "open", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "ODO"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "odo"}}, "gdEnglish": "Unveil", "note": "Printed once, with Key 1 (pp. 79-80, English p. 88); repeated here.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 79, "leaf": 172, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
