    {
      "key": 12,
      "casaubonCall": 8,
      "dictated": "Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. + Cracoviae.\", p.118 n207); the English Thursday 5 July 1584 (p.189 n278, which names the 14 invocations \"received 14 Maii\").",
      "note": "\"Δ. This is the eighth\" after the ending fragment (p.136 n225); English margin \"Δ 8 / 12\" (p.193 n282). Casaubon's print of the 14 May calls (pp.133-138) is damaged and out of order: lacunae printed as dots, and fragments of Keys 12, 13, 16 and 17 interleaved on pp.135-137 (the manuscript, Cotton Appendix XLVI, was damaged). The Enochian of Keys 14 and 15 and of the first 14 words of Key 16 is not printed at all; only a few of their words survive in the English pages' margins and in Dee's list of first words, p.200 n289 (12 July 1584).",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 79, "leaf": 172, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 135, "leaf": 224, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 136, "leaf": 225, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659", "equinox1912no8"], "covered": ["enochian", "english", "gd"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)", "the words Casaubon's print has damaged"]},
      "rows": [
        {"english": "O you", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "NONCI", "pronunciation": "Non ci, si."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "NONUCI"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "that range", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "DSONF", "pronunciation": "Dsonf."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "dasonuf"}}, "gdEnglish": "that range", "note": "One entry and one Crowley word (\"dasonuf\"); kept as one row. The English of the app's earlier text (2023) \"that / rayne\" (two rows); Casaubon prints \"that range\". Casaubon p.193 (English), p.134 (Enochian).", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "in the South,", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "BABAGE", "pronunciation": "Ba ba ge."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Babaje"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "and", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "OD", "pronunciation": "Od."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "od"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "are", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CHIS", "pronunciation": "Chis."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "cahisa"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "28.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "OB", "pronunciation": "Ob."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "ob"}}, "note": "English margin p.193 beside \"are / 28.\": \"Ob...... That you have not.\" (Crowley italicises ob).", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 134, "leaf": 223, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 119, "leaf": 149, "field": "gd"}]},
