    {
      "key": 14,
      "casaubonCall": 10,
      "dictated": "Enochian presumably 14 May 1584 with Keys 5-18 (p.189 n278 names 14 invocations received 14 May), but not printed in Casaubon. Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. + Cracoviae.\", p.118 n207); the English Thursday 5 July 1584 (p.189 n278, which names the 14 invocations \"received 14 Maii\").",
      "note": "English margin \"Δ 10 / 14\" (p.193 n282). Casaubon's print of the 14 May calls (pp.133-138) is damaged and out of order: lacunae printed as dots, and fragments of Keys 12, 13, 16 and 17 interleaved on pp.135-137 (the manuscript, Cotton Appendix XLVI, was damaged). The Enochian of Keys 14 and 15 and of the first 14 words of Key 16 is not printed at all; only a few of their words survive in the English pages' margins and in Dee's list of first words, p.200 n289 (12 July 1584).",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 79, "leaf": 172, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 200, "leaf": 289, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659", "equinox1912no8"], "covered": ["enochian", "english", "gd"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)", "the words Casaubon's print has damaged", "Dee's Enochian for 23 words Casaubon's print lost: Crowley's form stands in, with no source in Dee's spelling"]},
      "rows": [
        {"english": "O you sons", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "NOROMI", "pronunciation": "No Romi."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "NORONI"}}, "note": "Not in the 14 May print. Dee's list of the Calls' first words, 12 July 1584 (p.200 n289): \"15. —— O you sons / No Romi.\" Read NOROMI from that; Crowley NORONI. English margin p.193 \"Sons, Daughters.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 200, "leaf": 289, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "of fury,", "notInCasaubon": true, "readings": {"equinox1912no8": {"word": "bajihie"}}, "note": "Not in Casaubon's print: the Enochian of Key 14 is not printed (manuscript loss, pp.133-138). Row and its English follow Crowley's word division; the pairing of his word with Dee's English is ours. Casaubon's 'fury' has a badly printed u (reads like 'fary').", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "the daughters", "notInCasaubon": true, "readings": {"equinox1912no8": {"word": "pasahasa"}}, "note": "Not in Casaubon's print: the Enochian of Key 14 is not printed (manuscript loss, pp.133-138). Row and its English follow Crowley's word division; the pairing of his word with Dee's English is ours.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "of the just,", "notInCasaubon": true, "readings": {"equinox1912no8": {"word": "Oiada"}}, "gdEnglish": "of the Just One", "note": "Not in Casaubon's print: the Enochian of Key 14 is not printed (manuscript loss, pp.133-138). Row and its English follow Crowley's word division; the pairing of his word with Dee's English is ours.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "which", "notInCasaubon": true, "readings": {"equinox1912no8": {"word": "das"}}, "note": "Not in Casaubon's print: the Enochian of Key 14 is not printed (manuscript loss, pp.133-138). Row and its English follow Crowley's word division; the pairing of his word with Dee's English is ours.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "sit", "notInCasaubon": true, "readings": {"equinox1912no8": {"word": "tarinuta"}}, "note": "Not in Casaubon's print: the Enochian of Key 14 is not printed (manuscript loss, pp.133-138). Row and its English follow Crowley's word division; the pairing of his word with Dee's English is ours.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "on", "notInCasaubon": true, "readings": {"equinox1912no8": {"word": "mireca"}}, "gdEnglish": "upon", "note": "Not in Casaubon's print: the Enochian of Key 14 is not printed (manuscript loss, pp.133-138). Row and its English follow Crowley's word division; the pairing of his word with Dee's English is ours.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "24", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "OL", "printed": "Ol..... (margin)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "ol"}}, "uncertain": true, "note": "Only in the English page's margin p.193 n282: \"Nal.... / Ol.....\" beside \"sit / on\"; read as OL = 24 (Crowley italicises \"ol\" before \"tahila\"). The dots may hide more letters.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
