        {"english": "1636.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "QUAR", "printed": "Quar. (margin)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "quare"}}, "note": "Only in the English page's margin p.193 n282: \"Nal....; / Quar.\" beside \"under you / 1636.\"; Crowley italicises \"quare\".", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
