        {"english": "Furie or extream Justice.", "notInCasaubon": true, "readings": {"equinox1912no8": {"word": "Balatima"}}, "note": "Not in Casaubon's print: the Enochian of Key 14 is not printed (manuscript loss, pp.133-138). Row and its English follow Crowley's word division; the pairing of his word with Dee's English is ours. English printed \"Furie ——— or extream ——— Justice.\" with margin \"Nal.....\" beside it; margin \"Δ 10 / 14\".", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
