        {"english": "therefore", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CA"}, "equinox1912no8": {"marker": "absent"}}, "note": "Printed once, with Key 1 (pp. 79-80, English p. 88); repeated here. CA ('therefore') is in Key 1's ending and in Dee's note p.193 n282 that the closing words are '14 last words ... Zacar e ca, od zamran ...'; Crowley prints no word here for this Key and his English has no 'therefore'.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}]},
