    {
      "key": 15,
      "casaubonCall": 11,
      "dictated": "Enochian presumably 14 May 1584, not printed in Casaubon; \"of the first flame\" supplied Wednesday 11 July 1584 (p.193 margin) and its word on 12 July (p.200). Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. + Cracoviae.\", p.118 n207); the English Thursday 5 July 1584 (p.189 n278, which names the 14 invocations \"received 14 Maii\").",
      "note": "English margin \"Δ 11 / 15\" (p.193 n282). Casaubon's print of the 14 May calls (pp.133-138) is damaged and out of order: lacunae printed as dots, and fragments of Keys 12, 13, 16 and 17 interleaved on pp.135-137 (the manuscript, Cotton Appendix XLVI, was damaged). The Enochian of Keys 14 and 15 and of the first 14 words of Key 16 is not printed at all; only a few of their words survive in the English pages' margins and in Dee's list of first words, p.200 n289 (12 July 1584).",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 79, "leaf": 172, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 193, "leaf": 282, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 200, "leaf": 289, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 121, "leaf": 151, "field": "gd"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659", "equinox1912no8"], "covered": ["enochian", "english", "gd"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)", "the words Casaubon's print has damaged", "Dee's Enochian for 14 words Casaubon's print lost: Crowley's form stands in, with no source in Dee's spelling"]},
