      "dictated": "Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. + Cracoviae.\", p.118 n207); the English Thursday 5 July 1584 (p.189 n278, which names the 14 invocations \"received 14 Maii\").",
      "note": "\"That is the Twelfth.\" after MADZILODARP (p.136 n225); English margin \"Δ [12] / 16\" (p.194 n283). Casaubon's print of the 14 May calls (pp.133-138) is damaged and out of order: lacunae printed as dots, and fragments of Keys 12, 13, 16 and 17 interleaved on pp.135-137 (the manuscript, Cotton Appendix XLVI, was damaged). The Enochian of Keys 14 and 15 and of the first 14 words of Key 16 is not printed at all; only a few of their words survive in the English pages' margins and in Dee's list of first words, p.200 n289 (12 July 1584).",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 79, "leaf": 172, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 136, "leaf": 225, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 200, "leaf": 289, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 122, "leaf": 152, "field": "gd"}],
