      "key": 17,
      "casaubonCall": 13,
      "dictated": "Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. + Cracoviae.\", p.118 n207); the English Thursday 5 July 1584 (p.189 n278, which names the 14 invocations \"received 14 Maii\").",
      "note": "\"A voyce. That is the thirteenth.\" after TOATAR (p.137 n226); English margin \"[Δ. 13] / [17]\" (p.194 n283). Casaubon's print of the 14 May calls (pp.133-138) is damaged and out of order: lacunae printed as dots, and fragments of Keys 12, 13, 16 and 17 interleaved on pp.135-137 (the manuscript, Cotton Appendix XLVI, was damaged). The Enochian of Keys 14 and 15 and of the first 14 words of Key 16 is not printed at all; only a few of their words survive in the English pages' margins and in Dee's list of first words, p.200 n289 (12 July 1584).",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 88, "leaf": 181, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 79, "leaf": 172, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 80, "leaf": 173, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 135, "leaf": 224, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 136, "leaf": 225, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659", "equinox1912no8"], "covered": ["enochian", "english", "gd"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)", "the words Casaubon's print has damaged"]},
      "rows": [
        {"english": "O thou", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "ILS", "pronunciation": "ILS."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "ILASA"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals lost; the pronunciation column prints \"ILS.\" (p.136 n225), after \"That is the Twelfth\". p.200 n289 also gives \"Ils di al part.\" The capitals are lost in the print, printed as dots.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 136, "leaf": 225, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "third flame,", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "DIALPRT", "pronunciation": "Di alpert."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "dial pereta", "marker": "split"}}, "uncertain": true, "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals lost; pronunciation \"Di alpert.\" (p.136), \"di al part\" (p.200 n289). DIALPRT is our reading (cf. IALPRG \"I al purg\"), uncertain. On p.136 these two words are followed by the ending fragment of Key 12 (\"Za car. Go hus. ...\"); the rest of Key 17 is on p.135 and p.137. The capitals are lost in the print, printed as dots.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 136, "leaf": 225, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
