        {"english": "7336", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "TAXS", "pronunciation": "Taxs."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "faxisa"}}, "note": "Dee's margin p.194 n283: \"Faxs ---- Faxes or Faxis to be founded. I find in the Call Taxs. I finde also in some words T or F indifferently used.\" Crowley faxisa (F).", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 135, "leaf": 224, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "Lamps living", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "HUBARO", "pronunciation": "Hu ba ro.", "printed": "H..... (damaged)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "hubaro"}}, "gdEnglish": "living lamps", "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals keep only H; pronunciation \"Hu ba ro.\" gives HUBARO; Crowley agrees. Preceded by \"He maketh Cursie.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 135, "leaf": 224, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "going", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "TASTAX", "pronunciation": "Tas tax.", "printed": "TAST.. (damaged)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "tasataxa"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals \"TAST..\"; pronunciation \"Tas tax.\" gives TASTAX; Crowley tasataxa.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 135, "leaf": 224, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "before thee,", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "YLSI", "pronunciation": "Yl si.", "printed": "YL.. (damaged)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "yolasa"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. The capitals \"YL..\"; pronunciation \"Yl si.\" gives YLSI; Crowley yolasa.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 135, "leaf": 224, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "whose", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "SOBA", "pronunciation": "So bai ad.", "printed": "SOBAIAD (one entry)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "soba"}}, "note": "p.137 n226 top. The capitals print SOBAIAD as one entry; split SOBA + IAD as Crowley (\"soba Iad\") and the English \"whose God\".", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "God", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "IAD", "pronunciation": "So bai ad.", "printed": "SOBAIAD (one entry)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Iad"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "is", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "I", "pronunciation": "I von po vnph.", "printed": "IVONPOVNPH (one entry)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "i"}}, "note": "The capitals print IVONPOVNPH as one entry; split I + VONPO + VNPH by the pronunciation \"I von po vnph\" and the English \"is Wrath in Anger\". Crowley italicises i.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "Wrath", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "VONPO", "pronunciation": "I von po vnph.", "printed": "IVONPOVNPH (one entry)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Vonupehe o"}}, "note": "Dee's syllables give VONPO (no H; cf. VONPH \"wrath\" in Keys 12 and 13). Crowley divides differently: \"Vonupehe o Uonupehe\", i.e. VONPH + O + VNPH; his \"o\" is put here.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "in Anger.", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "VNPH", "pronunciation": "I von po vnph.", "printed": "IVONPOVNPH (one entry)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "Uonupehe"}}, "gdEnglish": "\"Wrath in Anger\" (quoted as a name)", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "Gird up", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "ALDON", "pronunciation": "Al don.", "printed": "AL.ON (damaged)"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "aladonu"}}, "note": "Damaged in the print. One capitals letter lost (AL.ON); pronunciation \"Al don.\" gives ALDON; Crowley agrees.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
