        {"english": "hearken.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "TOATAR", "pronunciation": "To a tar."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "toatare"}}, "note": "Followed by \"E.K. The Curtain is pluck't to. A voyce. That is the thirteenth.\" English p.194 \"...... Move, as before, &c.\"; margin \"[Δ. 13] / [17]\".", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 194, "leaf": 283, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 137, "leaf": 226, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 123, "leaf": 153, "field": "gd"}]},
