    {
      "key": 19,
      "dictated": "Thursday 12 July 1584 (p.200 'Thursday, Julii 12. a Meridie hora 4', Cracow; continued on p.203 under 'Thursday, Julii 12. Anno 1584', Liber 5 Cracoviensium Mysteriorum Apertorius) for rows 1-89 (to LSMNAD); rows 90-163 Friday 13 July 1584 ('Fryday, Julii 13. Mane hora 7', p.206)",
      "note": "Casaubon gives the nineteenth Call no number; Dee speaks of 'those 30 Calls, or thirty Call' (p.200) and is told 'Now change the name, and the Call is all one' (p.209). Dee's 48 Claves counts the thirty as Calls 19 to 48.",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 202, "leaf": 291}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 203, "leaf": 286}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 204, "leaf": 287}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 205, "leaf": 294}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 206, "leaf": 295}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 207, "leaf": 296}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 208, "leaf": 297}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 126, "leaf": 156, "field": "gd"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659", "equinox1912no8"], "covered": ["enochian", "english", "gd"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)"]},
      "rows": [
        {"english": "O you heavens", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "MADRIIAX"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "MADARIATZA"}}, "note": "Printed capitals MADRIIAX. No pronunciation: the third column holds Dee's note (with \"Ilemese.\" in the margin) that he thinks \"this word wanteth\", as may appear by \"Madriax\" about 44 words from the end; that later word (row 120) is also printed MADRIIAX. Crowley prints MADARIATZA here and Madariiatza at row 120. Keep as printed; the doubt is Dee's.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "which", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "DS", "pronunciation": "Ds praf.", "printed": "DSPRAF"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "das"}}, "note": "Dee entry printed as one, DSPRAF, glossed \"which dwell\" and pronounced \"Ds praf.\" as two words: split", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "dwell", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "PRAF", "printed": "DSPRAF"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "perifa"}}, "note": "second word of Dee entry DSPRAF. Its pronunciation is printed with the word before.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "In the {ordinal} air", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "LIL", "pronunciation": "Lil."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "LIL"}}, "slot": "aethyr", "note": "The Aethyr's name, which changes with the Aethyr. Casaubon prints \"In the first air\" (air, not aire). Crowley p.125 n.1: \"Or other Aire as may be willed.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "are", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CHIS", "pronunciation": "Kis / Chis Micáolz.", "printed": "CHISMICAOLZ"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "cahisa"}}, "note": "Dee entry printed as one, CHISMICAOLZ, glossed \"are mighty\"; pronounced \"Chis Micáolz.\" (with \"Kis\" above) as two words: split", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "mighty", "englishSplit": true, "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "MICAOLZ", "printed": "CHISMICAOLZ"}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "micaolazoda"}}, "note": "second word of Dee entry CHISMICAOLZ. Its pronunciation is printed with the word before.", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "in the parts", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "SAANIR", "pronunciation": "Sa á nir."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "saanire"}}, "note": "margin \"Ile.\" (Ilemese)", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
        {"english": "of the earth", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CAOSGO", "pronunciation": "Ca ós go."}, "equinox1912no8": {"word": "caosago"}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 201, "leaf": 290}, {"work": "equinox1912no8", "page": 125, "leaf": 155, "field": "gd"}]},
